The reason your Maker Status Screen (JournalPostingStatus) stepper is jumping to the wrong step is due to a **missing data point in your backend API**.
Your Checker screen (JournalAuthorization) works perfectly because its backend API (getPendingBatchesForChecker) explicitly returns the WORKFLOW_ORDER from the database. However, your Maker's backend API (getAllRequestsSummary) does **not** return the WORKFLOW_ORDER.
Because the frontend doesn't receive the order number, it tries to "guess" the step by matching string names, which fails and causes the stepper to jump erratically.
Here is the complete fix for both the Backend and the Frontend to perfectly sync the Maker screen with the Checker screen.
### 1. Backend Fix (VoucherRequestServiceImpl.java)
You must update getAllRequestsSummary to fetch and return w.WORKFLOW_ORDER. Replace your existing method with this:
```java
    public List<Map<String, Object>> getAllRequestsSummary() {
        String sql = """
            SELECT 
                p.BATCH_ID, 
                p.VID_FK,
                p.CREATED_BY AS CREATOR_ID, 
                COALESCE(u.FIRST_NAME || ' ' || u.LAST_NAME, p.CREATED_BY) AS CREATOR_NAME,
                p.CREATED_AT AS REQ_DATE, 
                p.RECORDS_COUNT AS TOTAL_ROWS, 
                p.BATCH_STATUS, 
                w.WORKFLOW_STAGE, 
                w.WORKFLOW_CODE,
                w.WORKFLOW_ORDER -- NEW: Fetch the exact numerical step order
            FROM VOUCHER_POSTING p
            LEFT JOIN WORKFLOW_TRANSITIONS w ON p.PENDING_AT = w.WORKFLOW_ID
            LEFT JOIN USERS u ON p.CREATED_BY = u.USER_ID
            ORDER BY p.CREATED_AT DESC
        """;

        return jdbcTemplate.query(sql, (rs, rowNum) -> {
            Map<String, Object> map = new HashMap<>();
            map.put("batchId", rs.getString("BATCH_ID"));
            map.put("vid", rs.getString("VID_FK"));
            map.put("creatorId", rs.getString("CREATOR_ID"));
            map.put("creatorName", rs.getString("CREATOR_NAME"));
            map.put("requestDate", rs.getTimestamp("REQ_DATE"));
            map.put("requestCount", rs.getLong("TOTAL_ROWS"));
            map.put("approvalWorkflow", rs.getString("WORKFLOW_CODE"));
            map.put("workflowState", rs.getString("WORKFLOW_STAGE")); 
            
            // NEW: Pass the exact order to the frontend
            map.put("currentOrder", rs.getObject("WORKFLOW_ORDER")); 

            String bStatus = rs.getString("BATCH_STATUS");
            if ("R".equals(bStatus)) map.put("currentStatus", "REJECTED");
            else if ("A".equals(bStatus) || "C".equals(bStatus)) map.put("currentStatus", "POSTED");
            else map.put("currentStatus", rs.getString("WORKFLOW_STAGE") != null ? rs.getString("WORKFLOW_STAGE") : "PENDING");

            return map;
        });
    }

```
